Package: gofdegrad
Type: Package
Title: Goodness-of-Fit Tests for Degradation Processes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Rytrace", "Tito", email = "tito.amedee-rytrace@univ-pau.fr", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Implementation of the goodness-of-fit testing method by similarity
    measures and parametric bootstrap of Zheng, Wang, Chen & Xie (2026,
    Quality and Reliability Engineering International). Supports Wiener,
    Gamma and Inverse Gaussian stochastic process degradation models
    (homogeneous and non-homogeneous), and general path degradation models
    (linear, power law, exponential).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/rytracetito/Article_zheng_chen_et_al
BugReports: https://github.com/rytracetito/Article_zheng_chen_et_al/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports:
    stats,
    statmod
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
